ary>Complete original row and provenance</summary><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify({raw:r.raw,sources:r.sources,detectionLimits:r.detectionLimits,characteristicInterpretation:r.characteristicInterpretation,detectionInterpretation:r.detectionInterpretation,history:r.history},null,2))}</pre></details></section>`;}
